# Title: Tamper Windows Defender Remove-MpPreference
# ID: 07e3cb2c-0608-410d-be4b-1511cb1a0448
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-05
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects attempts to remove Windows Defender configurations using the 'MpPreference' cmdlet
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:*Remove-MpPreference*) AND ((process.command_line:*-ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders * OR process.command_line:*-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Ids * OR process.command_line:*-AttackSurfaceReductionRules_Actions * OR process.command_line:*-CheckForSignaturesBeforeRunningScan *)))
